WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.080
Welcome back to the arena.

00:10.080 --> 00:17.240
So far in this season, you have done the deep work of discovery to create your inner blueprint.

00:17.240 --> 00:23.760
You have architected your M.V.P. and you've started to activate it in the real world, conditioning

00:23.760 --> 00:26.560
your resilience and agility.

00:26.560 --> 00:34.320
Now we arrive at a pivotal moment where strategy meets action in the most structured way possible.

00:34.320 --> 00:40.600
This lesson is where we pull it all together and into a tool that we truly use to elevate

00:40.600 --> 00:45.680
your performance, the 90-Day Way Personal Brand Action Plan.

00:45.680 --> 00:52.920
A study from Dominican University found that people who write down their goals are 42%

00:52.920 --> 00:55.160
more likely to achieve them.

00:55.160 --> 00:56.160
Why?

00:56.160 --> 01:01.720
Because the act of writing it down is the first step in creating a system.

01:01.720 --> 01:03.920
It's not just about setting goals.

01:03.920 --> 01:09.080
It's about having a system to achieve them consistently.

01:09.080 --> 01:11.960
This is what the 90-Day Way provides.

01:11.960 --> 01:18.160
Today we will explore the prerequisites for your success, show you how to identify and

01:18.160 --> 01:25.280
address your most critical gaps, and then guide you step by step in building your first

01:25.280 --> 01:27.000
90 Day Plan.

01:27.000 --> 01:33.240
The A.R.A.W. pillars we are conditioning are alignment and wellbeing, ensuring your plan is both

01:33.240 --> 01:35.920
purposeful and sustainable.

